{
  "name": "Give It a Twirl · integ.life",
  "short_name": "Give It a Twirl",
  "description": "A new skirt on a tailor's dress form. Swipe sideways and it spins: the hem swings out, rises into a cone and, with a hard flick, stands out flat like a plate. Then it slows and the folds fall back one by one. Four fabrics that each move differently: chiffon, denim, a pleated mamianqun and tulle. A tiny cloth-physics toy, no sign-up.",
